# Phase 1 Scope

# Goal

Build the database foundation for an ancient text concordance and linguistic research platform.

# MVP Includes

- Canon-aware book structure
- Verse storage
- Token-level word storage
- Lemma mapping
- Strong’s-style references
- Morphology support
- Lexicon entries
- Cross-language clarification records
- Data-quality validation queries

# QA Focus

- Referential integrity
- Duplicate detection
- Missing lemma detection
- Missing lexicon definition detection
- Apocrypha support
- Search-ready token structure
